  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La banda de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera ha oferit aquest migdia un extraordinari concert de primavera al seu auditori, dirigida pel seu titular, Jos&eacute; Dami&aacute;n Navarro Centelles.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/05/IMG_6884.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Amb la sala quasib&eacute; plena, a pesar que a l&#39;hora d&#39;anar la gent cap al concert plovia amb for&ccedil;a, a&nbsp;la primera part han interpretat Lanjar&oacute;n (F. Penella), Ross Roy (Jacob de Jaan) i Jurassic Park (John Williams). Per a la segonda part s&#39;ha deixat Gladiator (Hans Zimmer) i La m&aacute;scara del zorro (James Horner). El concert d&#39;ha acabat amb una pe&ccedil;a de regal: Tercio de quites, del compositor de Cullera Rafael Talens, que va morir fa quinze dies.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6874.jpg\" alt=\"img_6874\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6875.jpg\" alt=\"img_6875\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6876.jpg\" alt=\"img_6876\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6877.jpg\" alt=\"img_6877\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6878.jpg\" alt=\"img_6878\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6879.jpg\" alt=\"img_6879\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6880.jpg\" alt=\"img_6880\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6881.jpg\" alt=\"img_6881\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6883.jpg\" alt=\"img_6883\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6884.jpg\" alt=\"img_6884\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6885.jpg\" alt=\"img_6885\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6886.jpg\" alt=\"img_6886\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6887.jpg\" alt=\"img_6887\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6888.jpg\" alt=\"img_6888\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6889.jpg\" alt=\"img_6889\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6890.jpg\" alt=\"img_6890\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertprimaverauniomusicalsuera/img_6892.jpg\" alt=\"img_6892\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
